I assessed you on (state previous assessment date), you told me that you had difficulty with (read all activities from list at a time). Today, do you still have difficulty with: (read and have patient score each item in the list)?","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Lors de votre évaluation du (indiquer la date de l'évaluation précédente), vous m'avez dit que vous aviez des difficultés pour (lire toutes les activités de la liste une par une). Aujourd'hui, avez-vous toujours des difficultés pour : (lire et faire noter chaque activité de la liste par le patient) ?"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Cuando le evalué el (indique la fecha de la evaluación anterior), me dijo que tenía dificultades con (lea todas las actividades de la lista una por una). Hoy, ¿sigue teniendo dificultades con: (lea y haga que el paciente puntúe cada ítem de la lista)?"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Когда я осматривал вас (укажите дату предыдущего осмотра), вы сказали мне, что испытываете трудности с (прочитайте все виды деятельности из списка по очереди). Сегодня вы все еще испытываете трудности с: (прочитайте и попросите пациента оценить каждый пункт в списке)?"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"عندما قمت بتقييمك في (اذكر تاريخ التقييم السابق)، أخبرتني أنك واجهت صعوبة في (اقرأ جميع الأنشطة من القائمة في كل مرة). اليوم، هل لا تزال تواجه صعوبة في: (اقرأ واطلب من المريض تسجيل كل عنصر في القائمة)؟"}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"psfs-scoring-definition","text":"Patient-specific activity scoring scheme: Each activity has a score from 0 to 10.","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Schéma de notation des activités spécifiques au patient : Chaque activité est notée de 0 à 10."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Esquema de puntuación de la actividad específica del paciente: Cada actividad tiene una puntuación de 0 a 10."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Схема оценки деятельности конкретного пациента: Каждое действие оценивается от 0 до 10 баллов."}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"مخطط تسجيل الأنشطة الخاص بالمريض: كل نشاط له درجة من 0 إلى 10."}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"psfs-scoring-anchors","text":"0 points - Unable to perform activity; 10 points - Able to perform activity at the same level as before injury or problem","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"0 point - Incapable d'effectuer l'activité ; 10 points - Capable d'effectuer l'activité au même niveau qu'avant la blessure ou le problème"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"0 puntos - Incapaz de realizar la actividad; 10 puntos - Capaz de realizar la actividad al mismo nivel que antes de la lesión o el problema"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"0 баллов — не в состоянии выполнить действие; 10 баллов — в состоянии выполнить действие на том же уровне, что и до травмы или проблемы"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"0 نقطة - غير قادر على أداء النشاط؛ 10 نقاط - قادر على أداء النشاط بنفس المستوى الذي كان عليه قبل الإصابة أو المشكلة"}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"psfs-total-score-calculation","text":"Total score = sum of the activity scores/number of activities","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Score total = somme des scores d'activité / nombre d'activités"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Puntuación total = suma de las puntuaciones de las actividades / número de actividades"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Общий балл = сумма баллов за действия / количество действий"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"إجمالي الدرجة = مجموع درجات الأنشطة / عدد الأنشطة"}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"psfs-mdc-average","text":"Minimum detectable change (90%CI) for average score = 2 points","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Changement minimal détectable (IC à 90 %) pour le score moyen = 2 points"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Cambio mínimo detectable (IC del 90 %) para la puntuación media = 2 puntos"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Минимально значимое изменение (90% ДИ) для среднего балла = 2 балла"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"الحد الأدنى للتغيير الملحوظ (90% فاصل ثقة) لمتوسط الدرجة = نقطتان"}]}]},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"psfs-mdc-single","text":"Minimum detectable change (90%CI) for single activity score = 3 points","_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"fr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Changement minimal détectable (IC à 90 %) pour le score d'une seule activité = 3 points"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"es"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Cambio mínimo detectable (IC del 90 %) para la puntuación de una sola actividad = 3 puntos"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ru"},{"url":"content","valueString":"Минимально значимое изменение (90% ДИ) для оценки отдельного действия = 3 балла"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"ar"},{"url":"content","valueString":"الحد الأدنى للتغيير الملحوظ (90% فاصل ثقة) لدرجة نشاط واحد = 3 نقاط"}]}]},"type":"display"},{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-itemExtractionContext","valueExpression":{"name":"q1","language":"application/x-fhir-query","expression":"Observation"}}],"linkId":"q1-group","type":"group","item":[{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"http://hl7.org/fhir/questionnaire-item-control","code":"text-box"}]}},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression","valueExpression":{"language":"text/fhirpath","expression":"%observations.entry.resource.ofType(Observation).where(code.coding.code = 'c77e2d57-ae8a-4ab4-afd2-6